Sorry for the delay in getting back to you on this issue. It turns out 
that there is a function name conflict between Amelia and Hmisc. We're 
working on a fix, but, for now, you can load Amelia after Hmisc to 
eliminate the problem or run detach(package:Hmisc) to remove the conflict 
while running Amelia. Hope that helps!

cheers,
matt.

