Hi

the problem in your first example is that you don't really have a  
cross sectional time series data set, but just time series. Therefore  
you cannot set intercs=TRUE since you don't have any crosssections to  
interact with.

For the second error, check the list of your variables again to see  
if you don't have any nominal (factor) variables that aren't properly  
declared.

Raffael
